WEBVTT

00:04:29.730 --> 00:04:31.263
you have a longer charging time.

00:04:31.297 --> 00:04:33.530
But over the next 15 years,

00:04:33.563 --> 00:04:37.230
because the volume is there
and the R and D is being done,

00:04:37.263 --> 00:04:41.630
we can expect that the electric car
will be preferable.

00:04:42.497 --> 00:04:43.730
It won't cost more.

00:04:43.763 --> 00:04:47.497
It will have a much higher range.

00:04:47.497 --> 00:04:51.130
And so that green premium
that today is about 15 percent

00:04:51.163 --> 00:04:53.697
is headed to be zero

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:56.397
even without any government subsidies.

00:04:56.397 --> 00:04:57.697
And so that's magic.

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:02.030
That's exactly what we need to do
for every other category.